{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A World Powered by Adrenaline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sportia, sports aren\u2019t just events \u2014 they are what keep the world turning. Explore a living city that breathes competition, where every street trick and stadium goal shapes the environment around you. It\u2019s a place where energy is contagious, and the game never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/439ebd9087309486a3ea2736bedac50d.poster.avif?t=1773637745\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/439ebd9087309486a3ea2736bedac50d.webm?t=1773637745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/439ebd9087309486a3ea2736bedac50d.mp4?t=1773637745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Be the Spirit of the Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the unseen force guiding the athletes. Manage and evolve unique characters, mastering their special abilities and playstyles. Turn your squad into legends as you climb the ranks in a world that rewards your creativity and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/4633b86fe509cfe76e638be8ddbf09c1.avif?t=1773637745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras_big/4633b86fe509cfe76e638be8ddbf09c1.webp?t=1773637745 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Ultimate Arcade Chaos</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Variety:</strong> Compete in intense matches of football, rugby, tennis, and even parkour or climbing challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action &amp; Super Powers:</strong> Use the environment to your advantage and trigger special abilities like the Tsunami Strike to turn the tide in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond the Field:</strong> Explore a vibrant hub with quests, mini-games, and seasonal events that transform the city\u2019s look and feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Fun:</strong> Grab your friends for a couch full of laughs in local multiplayer or take on the world in competitive online leagues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/e7cf13807f9f849f8c91406fb0f5a08d.poster.avif?t=1773637745\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/e7cf13807f9f849f8c91406fb0f5a08d.webm?t=1773637745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/extras/e7cf13807f9f849f8c91406fb0f5a08d.mp4?t=1773637745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897390?t=1773637745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897390?t=1773637745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/d6df4f0fb9ea44ac03892e19af04d10bcaa87d43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773637745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897390/d6df4f0fb9ea44ac03892e